Harry's Attributes**:\n   - Harry is green (from context statement 7).\n   - **Green things are kind** (statement 14), so Harry is kind.\n   - **All kind things are quiet** (statement 12), so Harry is quiet.\n\n2. **Applying the Rules**:\n   - Harry is both **quiet** and **kind**. \n   - **Statement 10** states: \"All quiet, kind things are white.\" Since Harry satisfies both attributes (quiet and kind), he must be white.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - Harry must be white due to Statement 10. Therefore, the statement \"Harry is not white\" is **false**.\n\n**Answer**: **B) False**",
