gs are round.*  \n     Anne is both blue and red, so she must be **round**.  \n   - **Rule 1 and 6**: *All round things are blue and green.*  \n     As a round object, Anne must also be **green**, but this doesn\u2019t affect the \"blue\" conclusion.  \n\n4. **Consistency Check**:  \n   - **Rule 7**: *Round, cold things are big.*  \n     Anne is round and cold, so she must be big, which aligns with her given attribute.  \n   - **Rule 8**: *If something is green, it is blue.*  \n     This is satisfied since Anne is green and blue.  \n\nAll inferences are consistent with the rules and Anne\u2019s given attributes. Thus, **Anne is blue**.\n\n**Answer**: A) True",
