people are red** (statement 14), so Bob must be **red**.\n   - **Red people are smart** (statement 12), so Bob must be **smart**.\n\nEvery step follows logically from the premises. There are no contradictions or ambiguities in the chain of reasoning. Therefore, **Bob is smart**.\n\n**Answer**: A) True",
