nswer B) False. .\n\nHmm, this is a point of contention. In logic puzzles like this, typically, you have to follow all the rules and see if there\'s a contradiction, and resolve it by denying the necessary condition. Since the chain leads to a contradiction, the only way to resolve it is by denying the initial assumption (that he is smart). Therefore, my final option is: ']]
