n\u2019t stated.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - Fiona\u2019s non-roundness directly leads to her being non-red via the contrapositive of Premise 8. Thus, the statement \"Fiona is not red\" is **true**.\n\n**Answer**: A) True",
