19s temperature to any other premise. The only mention of \"cold\" (Premise 11) requires the bald eagle to visit the bear, which it does not.  \n\n**Conclusion**: The premises provide **no evidence** confirming or denying the bald eagle\u2019s coldness. Thus, the statement\u2019s truth value is **unknown**.  \n\n**Answer**: C) Unknown",
