oung.\n   - Premise 10: *All young people are furry*. Thus, Erin must also be furry, but her furrieness isn\u2019t explicitly stated. However, the absence of contradictory information means this doesn\u2019t invalidate the chain of reasoning.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - The statement \"Erin is not smart\" directly contradicts the conclusion derived above. Therefore, it is **false**.\n\n### Final Answer: B) False",
