 with all given rules.\n\n**Conclusion:** The mouse is young. The correct answer is **A) True**. The initial thought of **B) False** is incorrect because the logical chain explicitly proves the mouse must be young.\n\n<\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>  \n**Answer:**  \nA) True",
